## 5. KiCad 文件结构 (可导入格式)
为了方便你直接在 KiCad 中绘制，我提供了以下 **Netlist (网络表)** 逻辑，你可以将其导入 KiCad 的 Schematic Editor：

### Netlist Logic (Simplified)
```
(net (code 1) (name "3V3") (node (ref U4) (pin 1)) (node (ref U2) (pin 2)) (node (ref U10) (pin 16)))
(net (code 2) (name "GND") (node (ref U4) (pin 2)) (node (ref U1) (pin 2)) (node (ref U10) (pin 8)))
(net (code 3) (name "CAM_D0") (node (ref U4) (pin 26)) (node (ref U5) (pin 1)))
(net (code 4) (name "CAM_PCLK") (node (ref U4) (pin 21)) (node (ref U5) (pin 10)))
(net (code 5) (name "MOTOR_IN1") (node (ref U4) (pin 1)) (node (ref U10) (pin 2)))
(net (code 6) (name "MOTOR_PWM") (node (ref U4) (pin 18)) (node (ref U10) (pin 1)))
(net (code 7) (name "SPI_CS") (node (ref U4) (pin 5)) (node (ref U9) (pin 1)))
(net (code 8) (name "I2S_DIN") (node (ref U4) (pin 34)) (node (ref U6) (pin 1)))
```

